    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structcub_1_1GridEvenShare" kindref="compound">cub::GridEvenShare</ref> is a descriptor utility for distributing input among CUDA thread blocks in an &quot;even-share&quot; fashion. Each thread block gets roughly the same number of fixed-size work units (grains). </para>
